Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Good day, Gabriel. Remember me? I was your priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you've forgotten and repressed many things over the years,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not to blame for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I tell you about that time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then I'll let it rest. Faith doesn't solve every problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.78,0:00:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's a good compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Gabriel.
